      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the advice. i guess i'm just worried because some of the things i hear from other parents or see online seem to suggest that these concepts shouldn't be taught to kids this young, or that it might be confusing for them. how do i know if the \"respectful\" way is the only right way to handle it, or if there's more to the story? i just want to be sure i'm not missing anything important. maybe u can can can could explain both sides of why people think it should or",
